Name: esp_timeseries_octave
Version: 0.2.0
Date: 2026-09-14
Author: José Alexandre de França
Maintainer: José Alexandre de França <josealexandre@uel.br>
Title: ESP time-series transport client
Description: Receive and validate time-series captures using framed binary or
 retryable hexadecimal blocks, with CRC and channel metadata decoding.
 Offline decoding and tests require no hardware. Live serial communication
 additionally requires instrument-control with serialport and serialportlist.
Categories: Instrument Control
Depends: octave (>= 8.4.0)
License: MIT
Url: https://github.com/smartsensingme/esp_timeseries_octave
